{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30651","headline":"奉和秘监从翁夏日陕州河亭晚望 · 姚鹄","name":"奉和秘监从翁夏日陕州河亭晚望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洪河何处望，一境在孤烟。\n极野如蓝日，长波似镜年。\n卷帘花影里，倚槛鹤巢边。\n霞焰侵旌斾，滩声杂管弦。\n锺微来叠岫，帆远落遥天。\n过客多相指，应疑会水仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30651.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30651","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}